            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Secondary fracture prevention in aged people is most important issue for the reduction of fragility fractures. Implemetation of fractuire liaison service play a key role to achieve secondary fracture prevention with continuous and comprehensive care for fracture patients. Fracture Liaison Service are spread in world-wide, and demonstrated the effects for fracture incidence and economical aspects.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
